# Project Architecture (Chhata)

Production municipal survey, property-data, reporting, RBAC, and payment platform for **Nagar Panchayat Chhata, Mathura**.

## Stack

```text
Turborepo + pnpm
├── apps/portal/     # Next.js citizen/admin portal (App Router)
├── apps/api/        # NestJS HTTP API
├── apps/web/        # Next.js app (if present — do not invent a second stack)
├── packages/ui/     # Shared UI (extend; do not fork)
├── PostgreSQL + Prisma
├── Better Auth
└── Docker
```

## Default behavior

```text
Inspect → Understand → Reuse → Extend → Test
```

**Do not rewrite the monorepo.** Never replace architecture without understanding existing code.

## Core domains (keep modular)

Survey, Ward, Excel import/export, local file storage, RBAC, Users, Roles, Permissions, Reports, Payments, Offline collection, Gateway, Refunds, Settlements, Audit.

## Boundaries

- `apps/portal` / `apps/web` — UI only. No Prisma, Nest modules, secrets, or DB credentials.
- `apps/api` — HTTP, business logic, Prisma, authz, jobs. No React/Next imports.
- Shared packages — types, validation, UI, contracts. No browser secrets.

## Quality bar

Production-ready, secure, typed, testable, scalable (100K–1M+ rows), accessible, auditable. Optimize for reliable municipal use — not one-off demos.
